s. Art says: 'I only know what she tells me about school.' Julie provides extensive evidence of Olivia's advanced performance (scoring into 6th grade on reasoning), accuses Art of neglecting education for years. Art says: 'Gymnastics is all that's important to you.' Julie details $30,000+ spent on education and hundreds of hours teaching.", "relevance": "Another major fight about education, occurring approximately one year after the 2025-07-16 fight. Nearly identical content and structure, suggesting either a continuation of the same conflict or a recurring pattern. Art again claims gymnastics is the only priority; Julie again documents extensive academic work and financial investment."}], "uncertainties": ["The 2025-07-16 and 2026-07-01 fights have nearly identical content (Art's 'Gymnastics is all that's important to you' line, Julie's detailed curriculum defense). They may represent the same conversation duplicated across exports, or a recurring annual fight. The timestamps differ by ~1 year but message IDs are from different exports (decipher_export_19 vs decipher_export_5).", "The 2023-11-13 fight is about a 'microschool' (a small private/group homeschool) rather than traditional school. Whether this qualifies as a fight 'about school' depends on interpretation.", "Art's concerns about education sometimes blend with concerns about parenting time, gymnastics schedule, and financial responsibility. Disentangling pure 'school fights' from broader co-parenting conflicts is ambiguous."]}, "evidence_range_count": 4}, "result_path": "C:\\Users\\artwh\\OneDrive\\Documents\\legal2\\.tmp\\analysis-plan-proof\\20260730T025720Z\\ultra-current-result.json"}
